## Story levels 111-138: THE TRUE HUNT (lore by the user, 2026-11-25).
##
## Terra Patria, the first planet with breathable air, became a PRIME FRAGMENT OF EXISTENCE and is
## sealed by six of the nine layers of protection. The Nightmare Nourmish Clan (the Nightmare Lord's
## Troupe) slipped in before the seal; when the Storm woke up they struck, were thrown back by the
## planet's civilizations and fled into the caves. Now the heroes hunt the Nightmare Lord himself.
## He never harms the Warrior or the Architect, so BOTH heroes go: you play the one who did NOT chase
## the Enlightened One ("demi") and the other one fights beside you ("partner", always - "pal").
## EVERY regular enemy of the game appears (no bosses / mini-bosses; Madness enemies stay secret),
## herded by the Clan through lands torn up by NATURAL DISASTERS ("disasters": NatureDisaster kinds)
## on maps with ledges ("th_*" maps, StoryMaps). 2-5 waves per level. Milestones: 120 / 130 harder,
## 125 even harder. Level 138: THE NIGHTMARE MONSTROSITY (splits down to the 6th generation), then
## the Nightmare Lord's offer (NightmareOffer.gd: he joins you or he leaves).

